  "emojis": "👨‍🚀⚖️✨",
  "title": {
    "uz": "Taqqoslash: yoshlar va ifodalar",
    "ru": "Сравнение: возраст и выражения",
    "en": "Comparison: ages and expressions"
  },
  "recall": {
    "uz": "Ikki sonni taqqoslab, qaysi biri katta va qancha katta ekanini ayirish bilan topamiz. Masalan, 36 va 27 — 36 katta, u 36 - 27 = 9 ga katta. Yigʻindi va ayirmani ham hisoblaymiz.",
    "ru": "Сравнивая два числа, находим вычитанием, какое больше и насколько. Например, 36 и 27 — больше 36, на 36 - 27 = 9. Считаем также сумму и разность.",
    "en": "Comparing two numbers, we use subtraction to find which is bigger and by how much. For example 36 and 27 — 36 is bigger, by 36 - 27 = 9. We also find sums and differences."
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "type": "widget",
      "visualHint": "none",
      "media": {
        "gif": "/quiz-media/compare-diff.gif",
        "alt": {
          "uz": "Qancha koʻp? Farqni topamiz",
          "ru": "Насколько больше? Находим разность",
          "en": "How many more? We find the difference"
        },
        "maxWidth": 230
      },
      "widget": {
        "type": "mcq",
        "props": {
          "choices": [
            "9",
            "8",
            "10"
          ],
          "answerIndex": 0
        }
      },
      "prompt": {
        "uz": "Gagarin 27, Janibekov 36 yoshda uchgan. Qaysi katta va qancha?",
        "ru": "Гагарину было 27, Джанибекову 36. Кто старше и насколько?",
        "en": "Gagarin was 27, Janibekov 36. Who is older and by how much?"
      },
      "hint": {
        "uz": "36 dan 27 ni ayir.",
        "ru": "Вычти из 36 число 27.",
        "en": "Take 27 from 36."
      },
      "explanation": {
        "uz": "36 - 27 = 9.",
        "ru": "36 - 27 = 9.",
        "en": "36 - 27 = 9."
      }
    },
    {
